  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance humanitaire en abris pour les populations vuln&#xe9;rables affect&#xe9;es par les conflits en Ituri et au Nord-Kivu, R&#xe9;publique d&#xe9;mocratique du Congo (RDC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Shelter assistance to vulnerable communities affected by violence in the Ituri and North Kivu provinces of the Democratic Republic of Congo. This IOM project supports the upgrading of shelters of families hosting displaced households through both cash and in-kind assistance. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 10,331 people, including 2,930 women, 4,604 children, and 44 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
